{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5GgBKzeYijq6jwTJfk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old oak, iron-banded, set deep in a stone frame.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at my center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — one, two, three — each falling into place with a satisfying, ancient click.*\n\n*I shudder. Dust falls from my lintel.*\n\n*With a long, low creak, I swing inward, revealing what lies beyond:*\n\nA narrow corridor of cool air. Torchlight flickers against damp stone walls. The smell of earth and old rain. Somewhere ahead — footsteps that are not yours, retreating into the dark.\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":176,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}